# Fixture: arithmetic and comparison on money

```catala
declaration scope Arith:
  input a content money
  input b content money
  input r content decimal
  output total content money
  output difference content money
  output scaled content money
  output smaller content boolean

scope Arith:
  definition total equals a + b
  definition difference equals a - b
  definition scaled equals a * r
  definition smaller equals a < b
```
